  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TextData
  _TextInput: '* Speaking of knockback, upon taking damage, you will be unable to
    control where you go for a short amount of time. <br>During this time, you will
    ricochet off of walls upon colliding with them. <br>This Light Construct below
    will damage you upon contact and knock you back.'
  _TextSpeed: 5
  _TextSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c42031a9082a09841b9dec5007b952c9, type: 3}
